The published source is retained with a shared monotonic acknowledgement ID
allocator replacing random IDs in both clients. IDs are never reused by cloned
clients; exhaustion fails closed.
The Executor library test concurrent_calls_keep_unique_ack_ids_and_receive_their_own_response
checks 1,000 outstanding requests and reverse-order replies in GitHub CI.

Cargo.toml omits upstream example targets, whose files are not vendored.
No registry credentials, generated outputs, or local configuration are included.

